    "identifier": "kuru-black-art-dark-divergence-wave",
    "description": "<p>A beam of spiraling black chakra 60 feet long and 5 feet wide emanates from you in a direction you choose, infused with the scattered futures of your foes. Each creature in range must make a Dexterity saving throw.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures take half of 4d8 Necrotic damage.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures take 4d8 Necrotic damage and are mentally overwhelmed by the uncertainty of the future, being sent into a Berserk state.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same as failure, but Berserk cannot see any other creature, except those it originally considered its allies.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d8.</p>",
